        "label": "(a)",
        "question": "Name the pieces of equipment A and B.",
        "marks": 8,
        "model": "Equipment A is a burette (or graduated burette); Equipment B is a conical flask (or Erlenmeyer flask). The burette is used to deliver a measured volume of titrant during the titration, while the conical flask holds the analyte solution being titrated.",
        "diagram": "",
        "model_source": "ai-h1"
