        "question": "Answer the questions below with reference to compounds A, B and C in the following reaction scheme:\nCH₃CH₂Br → (X) → CH₂CH₂ → (Y) → CH₃CH₂OH\n                   (Z)\nWhich one of the three compounds has only planar carbon atoms in its molecules?\nDraw the structure of this compound.",
