        "question": "The oxidation of potassium sodium tartrate by hydrogen peroxide catalysed by cobalt(II) ions provides evidence for the intermediate formation theory of catalysis. State the observations you would make when carrying out this experiment.\nExplain how these observations provide evidence for the intermediate formation theory.",
