        "marks": 12,
        "model": "Strong acid (0.5 M):\nStrong monobasic acid dissociates completely: HA → H⁺ + A⁻\n[H⁺] = 0.5 mol dm⁻³\npH = –log(0.5) = 0.30\n\nWeak acid (0.5 M, Ka = 1.8 × 10⁻⁵):\nWeak acid dissociation: HA ⇌ H⁺ + A⁻\nKa = [H⁺][A⁻]/[HA]\nAssuming [H⁺] = [A⁻] = x and [HA] ≈ 0.5:\n1.8 × 10⁻⁵ = x²/0.5\nx² = 9.0 × 10⁻⁶\nx = [H⁺] = 3.0 × 10⁻³ mol dm⁻³\npH = –log(3.0 × 10⁻³) = 2.52",
